      "id": 3,
      "claim": "No laptop model or manufacturer holds a Fairtrade International certification for a laptop product.",
      "evidence": "A query of the Fairtrade International certified‑product database (downloaded March 2024) returns zero entries for any laptop; sustainability reports of major laptop makers (Apple, Dell, Lenovo, HP, ASUS, Acer, Fairphone) contain no mention of a Fairtrade label on their hardware.",
      "weight": 0.30,
      "depends_on": [1, 2]
    },
